    "Ten issuer groups; approximately twenty target labels, not enough to substantiate a general 98% precision rate. Same issuers/templates as diagnostics; fresh source periods, not unseen issuers.",
    "One agent independently checks labels against SEC document/primary/index and retained evidence; no second human adjudicator or pristine external blind test. No LLM extraction."
  ],
  "prior_exposure": "Issuer formats and later periods were examined in Sessions 1\u20134. Only submissions metadata was read for this reservation; no reserved release/exhibit body was read to develop v2. Earlier companyfacts can contain these periods; prior cache presence alone does not prove blindness. Context is not development data. Gold is to be curated after v2 rules freeze without retuning.",
  "reserved_at": "2026-11-13T03:24:53.875546+00:00",
  "selection_procedure": "For each of the existing ten issuers, choose the latest original 8-K with Item 2.02 filed April 1\u2013July 31, 2023, absent from gold_v1. Reserve the immediately previous such earnings filing (since Nov 1, 2022) as context only. Both filings and all exhibits, amendments and target-guidance versions stay in one issuer group. No replacement based on extraction difficulty or guidance presence. A release with no eligible guidance remains a negative evaluation document.",
  "selection_refinement_before_commit": "A metadata-only 2024 proposal was rejected before reading release bodies because its annual targets overlap later FY2025 guidance exposed in v1. The 2023 window avoids that annual-period overlap. Proposal retained only in local cache."
